Caption: 🥟 Crispy Punjabi Vegetable Samosas 🥟
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🥨 Pastry dough (flour, 🫒 oil, carom seeds), 🥔 2 large boiled potatoes, 🫛 1/2 cup peas, 🥄 cumin, coriander, garam masala, amchur (mango powder), 🌶️ and green chilies. 
