Caption: 🍝 Classic Fettuccine Alfredo 🍝
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🍝 400g fettuccine pasta, 1 cup heavy cream, 🧈 1/2 cup unsalted butter, 🧀 1.5 cups freshly grated Parmesan cheese, 🧂 black pepper, 🌿 and fresh parsley. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Boil the pasta in salted water. 🥣 In a large skillet, melt butter into the cream over medium heat; simmer for 2 mins. 🔥 Slowly whisk in the parmesan until the sauce is smooth and thick. ⏲️ Add the cooked pasta and a splash of pasta water. 🍳 Toss vigorously to coat. 🔪 Finish with a heavy crack of black pepper and parsley.
#alfredo #pasta #italianfood #creamy #dinner #comfortfood #cheese #fettuccine 🌮🍱'
