Steps: 👨‍🍳 Wet your hands and form 2 tbsp of rice into a small, oblong mound. 🥣 Slice the fish at a 45-degree angle into thin rectangles. 🔥 Dab a tiny bit of wasabi on the underside of the fish and press it gently onto the rice mound. ⏲️ Serve with pickled ginger and a small dish of soy sauce mixed with wasabi.
