Caption: 🍕 Authentic Wood-Fired Neapolitan Pizza 🍕
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🥨 Double-zero (00) flour dough, 🍅 San Marzano tomato sauce, 🧀 fresh buffalo mozzarella, 🌿 fresh basil leaves, 🫒 and extra virgin olive oil. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Stretch the dough by hand, leaving a thick rim (cornicione). 🥣 Spread a few spoons of sauce and dot with fresh mozzarella. 🔥 Add basil and a swirl of oil. ⏲️ Bake at 900°F (480°C) for 90 seconds. 🍳 The result should be soft, pillowy, and charred with 'leopard spots' on the crust.
